    labs: "Pathology: Moderately differentiated adenocarcinoma of the ascending colon. Tumour invading through muscularis propria into serosa (pT3). 3 of 18 lymph nodes positive (pN1b). Margins negative (R0 resection). MSI status: MSS (microsatellite stable). KRAS/NRAS/BRAF: wild-type. CEA (baseline): 5.2 ng/mL (mildly elevated). FBC, LFTs, Cr: normal.",
    imaging: "CT chest/abdomen/pelvis (post-op): no residual disease, no metastases. Colonoscopy: clear.",
